{{!
    @template local_nextpool/item_facts

    Facts of a catalogue item in the card of its latest version (task165): the update mode and "All rights
    reserved" (task169) as icons only, the other facts as read-only pills, and the technical details on request.

    An icon carries no meaning alone: its name is visually hidden text, the sentence is its tooltip, and it is
    focusable, so the tooltip also opens from the keyboard. Each pill shows a short text; label and full text
    are visually hidden and its tooltip.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * iconfacts - array of {icon (HTML), label, description}: the update mode and, without a licence,
      "All rights reserved" (task169)
    * facts - array of {icon (HTML, '' without), short, full}
    * technical - array of {label, value (HTML)}

    Example context (json):
    {
        "iconfacts": [
            {
                "icon": "",
                "label": "Updates in courses: Direct",
                "description": "Updates in courses: In place (learner progress is kept)"
            },
            {"icon": "", "label": "Licence: All rights reserved", "description": "Licence: All rights reserved"}
        ],
        "facts": [
            {"icon": "", "short": "Library", "full": "Storage location: Library"},
            {"icon": "", "short": "CC BY 4.0", "full": "Licence: Creative Commons - 4.0 International"}
        ],
        "technical": [{"label": "Identifier", "value": "0f8c4b1e"}]
    }
}}
<ul class="local-nextpool-itemfacts list-unstyled d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mt-2 mb-1 small" aria-label="{{#str}} itemdetails, local_nextpool {{/str}}">
    {{#iconfacts}}
        <li><span class="local-nextpool-factsicon d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" tabindex="0" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" title="{{description}}">{{{icon}}}<span class="visually-hidden">{{label}}</span></span></li>
    {{/iconfacts}}
    {{#facts}}
        <li class="local-nextpool-chip d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-1 text-break" title="{{full}}">{{{icon}}}<span aria-hidden="true">{{short}}</span><span class="visually-hidden">{{full}}</span></li>
    {{/facts}}
</ul>
<details class="local-nextpool-technical small mb-1">
    <summary>{{#str}} technicaldetails, local_nextpool {{/str}}</summary>
    <dl class="mb-0 mt-2">
        {{#technical}}
            <dt class="text-muted fw-normal">{{label}}</dt>
            <dd class="mb-2 text-break">{{{value}}}</dd>
        {{/technical}}
    </dl>
</details>
